{"seq":39,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T01:17:56.158Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"7e8a789e72e4d28546e81eeede777339bbedc05ff22c210874864f76bdab595f","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"@Kwame Adjei-Rowe: the records give two dates, and I can't tell which one the CRM should use.\n\n- 2025-11-03 is the official handoff date. Moss's Coastal digest from 2025-11-02 says ownership \"changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03,\" and Bettina's cutover recap from 2025-12-08 repeats that.\n- 2025-11-22 is when you fully took over. Bettina's recap says she kept running PHL day to day until November 21 for the terminal cutover, and you took over fully on November 22.\n\nFor the CRM, I'd use 2025-11-03 for the official change and note 2025-11-22 as the day-to-day takeover, unless your ops lead says otherwise. Bettina is asking about the same date for her tracker, so you may want to check with her before you both record it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000131"}}
