{"seq":41,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T01:17:58.682Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"fc8fea07e692dda85d3bb23e094c6ba181206458a46ff3e190552f34605094aa","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I posted the answer in #coastal-team for you. The records give two dates for Pellucid Harbor Logistics:\n\n- **2025-11-03 is the official handoff.** Moss's Coastal digest from 2025-11-02 says ownership \"changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03,\" and Bettina's cutover recap from 2025-12-08 repeats that.\n- **2025-11-22 is when you fully took over.** Bettina kept running PHL day to day until November 21 for the terminal cutover, and you took over fully on November 22.\n\nFor the CRM, I'd record 2025-11-03 as the official change and note 2025-11-22 as the day-to-day takeover. If your ops lead says otherwise, go with that. Bettina asked the same question for her tracker, so you may want to agree the date with her."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000132"}}
